<h2 class="pp-h2">Your outlet powers <em>thousands of dollars</em> of electronics</h2>
<p class="pp-lede">The TV, the laptop, the console, the router and everyone's phones all draw from the same old outlet. One surge from a storm, a grid switch or a big appliance kicking on can fry them. Plug-Pal puts a surge protector between the wall and everything you plug in.</p>
