<li class="pp-feat"><span class="pp-feat__ico"><svg class="pp-icon"><use href="#i-bed"/></svg></span><h3>Bedside</h3><p>Lamp, phones, watch and earbuds charging at once. No more fighting over chargers.</p></li>
