<li class="pp-feat"><span class="pp-feat__ico"><svg class="pp-icon"><use href="#i-moon"/></svg></span><h3>Hallway &amp; Nursery</h3><p>A soft glow comes on at dusk for night feeds and 3am trips.</p></li>
</ul>
