<section class="pp-section pp-section--wash" id="compare">
<div class="pp-wrap pp-cmp">
<div class="pp-cmp__head">
<h2 class="pp-h2">Plugged In <em>Without the Wobble</em></h2>
<p class="pp-lede">Cheap cube adapters sag out of worn outlets and give you three plugs. Plug-Pal screws flat to the wall and gives you nine ports.</p>
</div>
<div>
<table class="pp-cmp__table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col"><span class="pp-sr">Feature</span></th><th scope="col" class="pp-cmp__us">Plug-Pal</th><th scope="col">Cube adapter</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><th scope="row"><b>Screws to the wall</b><span>Won't sag or pull out of a worn outlet</span></th><td class="pp-cmp__us"><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="Yes"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></td><td><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="No"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row"><b>9 ports from 2 sockets</b><span>5 outlets + 4 USB, not 3 plugs</span></th><td class="pp-cmp__us"><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="Yes"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></td><td><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="No"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row"><b>USB-C + USB-A built in</b><span>No more charger-brick pile</span></th><td class="pp-cmp__us"><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="Yes"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></td><td><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="No"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row"><b>Surge protected</b><span>Guards the electronics plugged into it</span></th><td class="pp-cmp__us"><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="Yes"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></td><td><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="No"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row"><b>Night light</b><span>Glows on by itself at dusk</span></th><td class="pp-cmp__us"><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="Yes"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></td><td><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="No"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row"><b>Load guide included</b><span>Tells you what not to plug in</span></th><td class="pp-cmp__us"><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="Yes"><use href="#i-check"/></svg></td><td><svg class="pp-icon" aria-label="No"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="pp-cmp__note">Compared with a typical unmounted 3-way cube adapter.</p>
</div>
